      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNSTABLE MABLE (1) is a sprinter who thrives over these shorter races. Was too tough when scoring last time over 352m at this track in a Free For All (19.73). Has a strong record at this distance including six wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from seven starts. Well placed and will be tough to beat. WICKET (2) was a little disappointing last start at this track when 7th (25.81) over 457m. Form here at the trip excellent including four wins. Can do much better this time. SUMMER'S SCRUB (3) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 19.63 beating UNSTABLE MABLE. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Expected to measure up again. ONE LAST BEER (7) was out of placings last time (22.35) at Townsville in a OPEN, finishing seventh and beaten 11 lengths. Has already won out of this draw.",
